                <syl /><neume facs="#m-240d31cb-8734-40f6-9e2f-551eb3fd3b4a" type="podatus" xml:id="m-eb8dd969-9b58-4b8a-9b3a-47d4aed2af54">
                  <nc xml:id="m-bacd8cb5-cc92-4949-90d5-2af674b3253c" pname="g" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-f030fcaf-51d8-4f6b-8ff8-ec5d62beb3ad" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-449ab18b-667b-46cc-8f0f-42320d5ed647">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-e6c1f09a-ac8f-41ec-8d56-4272ef46ea0e" type="punctum" xml:id="m-9c0a54e1-a60b-4ba5-87ad-f95ec6819696">
                  <nc xml:id="m-ed4aef3a-0a62-4b39-9c16-c5efa5beed56" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-87fc847d-8bcf-4f3a-bed4-233dcd280b52">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-75590717-aeed-4b7e-afee-093f511a1238" type="clivis" xml:id="m-cc67c132-c7ca-44de-9b7f-239df1e8c2a9">
                  <nc xml:id="m-27fad304-d44f-4f91-bd05-946e2acccb27" pname="g" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-93763473-84df-42a2-bc96-33c54d68cb02" /></nc><nc xml:id="m-d7c22702-593d-46e8-ac84-c69a6a760b3e" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-04a74576-1140-42e2-97ee-d99da794ec92" facs="#m-6de1240e-df6e-4e44-94f6-bcafc15e21f5" form="maxima" /><divLine xml:id="m-e804da36-0e4f-4c3f-a47f-04e9ef36869a" facs="#m-0828ef20-7c1d-4b63-b064-642fb7cd6906" form="maxima" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-771ea95d-b9b6-4a92-842e-3c449c5e3039"><lg xml:id="m-74b3f41f-e553-438b-bcd4-8fb87e52eed2"><l xml:id="m-96cb68b8-9379-4cd6-b359-046d45445a34" facs="#m-ee85ac76-2e63-4ea4-bc56-d8d629875178" label="text-like">The Bunal Service.</l><l xml:id="m-70e3b7af-1472-4e1b-bc16-91c2b01a8698" facs="#m-a7258f28-785d-429b-a06e-2998ae9f5e30" label="text-like">The Bearing of the Corpse to the church.</l><l xml:id="m-a328f9ef-938c-43c4-a862-dda71dd6c4d9" facs="#m-762750b3-1aab-4889-a11d-edcc385613c1" label="text-like">The Priest, vested in surplice and black stole, sometimes even in black</l><l xml:id="m-c84b0d75-71ff-4175-bacc-8fc168eff997" facs="#m-44e4ccdd-aa41-4c38-b662-2a37942c8fed" label="text-like">cope, goes to the house of the deceased, accompanied by the Clergy. He is</l><l xml:id="m-7fb0a1b1-0c69-4aa8-b566-c0599c79fbfc" facs="#m-2b0c958c-5e7e-4ad0-a8ad-52f9e05e0054" label="text-like">preceded by the Cross-bearer and an acolyte carrying holy water.</l><l xml:id="m-652a1685-4193-48af-b684-fd6af91950cc" facs="#m-96080d57-5d50-4dcb-813b-ca449039e13a" label="text-like">The priest sprinkles the corpse with holy water and intones the antiphon</l><l xml:id="m-816e7f27-2fe4-414f-b251-9e66646b96fa" facs="#m-3e7e386c-9837-4c37-99fa-04a2e9ffaa01" label="lyrics-like">si iniquitátes.</l><l xml:id="m-ded751b1-b5ff-4a97-ae54-0ad7351a5b42" facs="#m-1c96b3ee-9098-4695-830c-878e29e833f6" label="ambiguous">Psalm 129.</l><l xml:id="m-3b0bb788-db22-45d1-9049-60d102249877" facs="#m-e0e6fa01-a862-4097-a1a6-7966a75209a2" label="lyrics-like">éjus:*sperávit ánima méa in Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-adea786e-d5f7-4abb-9608-4c632b0a5542" facs="#m-c2612a38-18e2-45e9-b4f8-126aa1080d9f" label="lyrics-like">E profúndis clamávi ad te Dó¬mino.</l><l xml:id="m-7e462e63-5e47-4eea-ae93-8071bc37399c" facs="#m-6644e650-9ee4-4317-a4de-7e156000ed3e" label="lyrics-like">L mine:" Dómine exáudi vócem</l><l xml:id="m-a260cfb1-7c15-4765-b3fb-4032e59e316a" facs="#m-d4de4ee3-6450-4324-a46c-bfd66f9d169e" label="lyrics-like">A custódia matutina usque ad</l><l xml:id="m-9722f906-de8c-40f8-b6c6-c0b804d0c967" facs="#m-3b389c19-20d8-41ec-b9da-d4b6e1126352" label="lyrics-like">méam.</l><l xml:id="m-566f8da4-ca15-4dcb-9320-0502a6840deb" facs="#m-1c01208d-3256-4d9b-8256-66ca19fddf09" label="lyrics-like">nóctem, *spéret Israel in Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-fb7df610-c08d-4c41-b4c0-fbebbc175b70" facs="#m-df11d172-f4a6-413e-906f-eae43c5f00c9" label="lyrics-like">Flant áures túae intendéntes* in</l><l xml:id="m-39bee1a5-0b91-4da6-9bb7-68e5928f8583" facs="#m-f97422d7-c97e-496d-9fa1-9a214d963222" label="lyrics-like">Quia apud Dóminum misericór¬</l><l xml:id="m-45cf942d-5206-4302-8839-328fe887370a" facs="#m-8edd0458-4403-4625-b03e-f9f9ae68f87f" label="lyrics-like">dia:*et copiósa apud éum redém¬</l><l xml:id="m-4fea6880-a81a-4a1b-b815-e0b8925a5626" facs="#m-af6ba07e-0c13-446e-ac6e-95f83f9a6d40" label="lyrics-like">vócem deprecatiónis méae.</l><l xml:id="m-679a195c-0d4f-4d45-8088-6f90096abdec" facs="#m-a38c418c-8255-4237-8e9e-767a9312c06e" label="lyrics-like">si iniquitâtes observáveris Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6a4a43d0-54f6-498b-81f4-52f220ac9160" facs="#m-9db8a783-5bc1-4c74-9f01-c1b8894d0d23" label="ambiguous">ptio.</l><l xml:id="m-5a395a60-d523-4ded-b20f-a9999a532a75" facs="#m-75a792ec-327e-4e86-8d52-c3dde40a2d2a" label="lyrics-like">Et ipse rédimet Israel * ex ómni¬</l><l xml:id="m-d1ab8c59-cd75-428d-934a-2ea88ee9dfe3" facs="#m-597878b9-9290-4695-88a0-adfd62cd9260" label="lyrics-like">ne:* Dómine, quis sustinébit?</l><l xml:id="m-2c7c8e8d-cc6f-40d9-a773-5c4d2f371889" facs="#m-901cda1b-0505-477f-960d-dd3eeb8295e4" label="lyrics-like">Quia apud te propitiátio est :* et lbus iniquitátibus éjus</l><l xml:id="m-05423c1d-6ff7-41a0-b0ed-94104ee8fe11" facs="#m-f4c01ed8-6ffe-4ca8-941c-7f3972b70670" label="lyrics-like">Réquiem aetérnam“ dóna éi</l><l xml:id="m-bc2329d8-0f18-4591-a7bf-1949a770d2a0" facs="#m-4e14ddd3-084c-4dbf-af1e-448a2f7ad1f5" label="lyrics-like">propter lègem tüam sustinui te Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-7c8665ba-83ba-4547-822f-64c6d76cccd6" facs="#m-5d4003cb-379d-4a28-bd7c-09dd4f655020" label="lyrics-like">Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-0614c20e-f697-4652-a3d3-b23482c97218" facs="#m-f45d3e06-953d-4bd1-bbfc-8d283abbd9d5" label="ambiguous">mine.</l><l xml:id="m-2dcdc9cf-7d39-451e-b0eb-e96e40a5e4c9" facs="#m-baa23863-807d-4e16-bfc7-c29615bc9a37" label="lyrics-like">Sustinuit ánima méa in vérbo! Et lux perpétua “lúceat éi¬</l><l xml:id="m-126562b5-ad70-487c-b075-98e972704f9c" facs="#m-c86a1551-10dc-41ad-a366-a0bfd054535c" label="lyrics-like">The Antiphon is reveated: Si iniquitátes observáveris Dómine: Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-3eb055f5-7d61-4523-83a8-f2a77d8ef9cc" facs="#m-b8594fa6-e500-4850-b8c0-04f256ae6cf8" label="lyrics-like">quis sustinébit!</l><l xml:id="m-c793ef3c-bccc-4cf6-b6d9-add5adc31f20" facs="#m-4fb6567e-3e51-4be6-9ae6-7f974dfa4c42" label="text-like">The corpse is then borne to the church. On leaving the house, the priest</l><l xml:id="m-c52d43f6-bfb6-4607-b622-00dd53752b07" facs="#m-f862467e-7160-4ffb-9bbf-c9a20ca8f392" label="text-like">solemnly intones the Antiphon:</l><l xml:id="m-c7af2ef4-27a5-4e7e-96ec-5a64c75c29e9" facs="#m-9d80faa2-ccec-4c19-ad90-b03c0c6af8e4" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-20319d9e-5794-475c-bcc2-32febf950b9f" facs="#m-e4857774-a2a2-4f5b-bbd9-c53a3e8a1735" label="ambiguous">i.1</l><l xml:id="m-72d34ef6-5c63-4820-8dd0-72acba28a463" facs="#m-797314d1-ebd0-424c-8011-8ef3a4ec997c" label="lyrics-like">Xsultábunt Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-7200ad83-8baa-404a-b236-9a8359de66ff" facs="#m-800de2fc-8482-468f-bf8d-f9c3eda68091" label="ambiguous">Psalm 50.</l><l xml:id="m-7ef0fff7-2f89-4337-8e53-32dfe6092d24" facs="#m-7b2a881a-cbe8-4d99-a5a1-aca2b6b23507" label="text-like">The CantorsE</l><l xml:id="m-9a4c8c7c-3c45-4f1c-9428-b10f4b7a678c" facs="#m-a923de02-2b2e-47cb-a704-4ef328194249" label="ambiguous">intone:</l><l xml:id="m-1618d74b-fc3b-4a46-818a-42b47e1ecf80" facs="#m-f63a152b-a993-4898-b87b-46e28959a51d" label="lyrics-like">1. Mi-se-ré-re mé¬ i Dé- us,</l><l xml:id="m-1328b1e0-1a55-4024-955e-0cebe0b2465b" facs="#m-0596a40c-27e6-4d5a-856e-05c762d832b1" label="ambiguous">rne Clergy!</l><l xml:id="m-f83d2678-479c-4d07-978a-9b11c96aecd4" facs="#m-095e1c76-5cd5-4e78-b266-2e9b75107016" label="ambiguous">in 2 Choirs.</l><l xml:id="m-a4d9d68e-664a-483a-bb75-d401818da193" facs="#m-55b2ab6c-a9b1-4b0d-b8bb-7e7ec592b18e" label="ambiguous">continue:</l><l xml:id="m-af784f68-a4b2-4fb0-a730-f41ec6fd3f89" facs="#m-e564b635-527f-4fcc-ba63-367ac4c3fc30" label="lyrics-like">secúndum mágnam mi-se-ri-córdi-am tú¬ am.</l><l xml:id="m-38b76c42-1412-4887-884f-e8f3d4905491" facs="#m-4eaff42c-4efe-46a9-a0a9-272040c884f0" label="lyrics-like">2. Et secúndum multitúdinem miseratiónum tuárum, * déle iniqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-80029f94-ac62-4cba-8ffb-86b889bb998a" facs="#m-10fafee5-bb1c-4d9b-bf6c-6e7a1e85be07" label="lyrics-like">tatem méam.</l><l xml:id="m-3f64bfde-c46d-40db-aea7-db30935c8f9b" facs="#m-f867a92a-073f-4963-9161-28b8ea85e285" label="text-like">"If two or more deccased are buried at the same time, this Versicle is said "</l><l xml:id="m-0606e239-c351-4f5f-9845-7affd86f8678" facs="#m-2c2f578b-9d74-4155-bb28-10707c7c1e77" label="text-like">time in the plural, as are also the other Versicles and the Pravers, with the excentica</l><l xml:id="m-a381c526-2a57-40b7-8975-c25d418cb87f" facs="#m-7936a370-037f-4118-b530-95c30d73b439" label="lyrics-like">ef the Prayẽr Non intres.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>